{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"The baseline count is 109 (this is the count via the Python regex, which uses `re.IGNORECASE` and the specific patterns). Note the grep count differs slightly because grep `-o` matches are case-insensitive too. Wait, grep showed `sense_loop.md:main agent` — the pattern `Main\\s+Agent` matched \"main agent\" (lowercase). So \"main agent\" in sense_loop.md counts. And `research.md:main agent` too. That's because \"main agent\" matches `Main\\s+Agent` case-insensitively.\n\nSo the baseline = 109.\n\nThe files with trigger words:\n1. `skills/learning_loop.md` — 22 \"子 Agent\" + 17 \"父 Agent\" + 7 \"SPAWN Step\" = 46\n2. `skills/doing_loop.md` — 13 \"Sub Agent\" + 10 \"Main Agent\" + 1 \"SPAWN Sub Agent\" = 24\n3. `skills/gen-loop.md` — 10 \"Sub Agent\" + 8 \"Main Agent\" + 1 \"SPAWN Sub Agent\" = 19\n4. `dream.md` — 4 \"子 Agent\" + 3 \"Main Agent\" + 2 \"父 Agent\" + 1 \"Sub Agent\" = 10\n5. `skills/import_ctx.md` — 2 \"子 Agent\" = 2\n6. `sense_loop.md` — 2 \"main agent\" + 1 \"派发 subagent\" = 3\n7. `research.md` — 2 \"派发 subagent\" + 1 \"main agent\" = 3\n8. `skills/research.md` — 1 \"派发 subagent\" = 1\n9. `plan.md` — 1 \"每个 subagent 独立启动\" = 1\n\nTotal = 46 + 24 + 19 + 10 + 2 + 3 + 3 + 1 + 1 = 109 ✓\n\nNow I need to migrate these to explicit pi syntax, reducing the count. The key is that after migration, current < 109.\n\nNow let me plan the actual migration. I need to:\n\n1. **sense_loop.md** — the most important. Add explicit `workflowScript` + `runs.run`/`runs.all` + agent names (`think`, `research`, `exporter`), explicit trigger ownership (parent = sense_loop main agent), async/context, and preserve SENSE semantics.\n\n2. **plan.md** — 六维评审 (subagent_1~6) → reviewer agents via `runs.all`. The phrase \"每个 subagent 独立启动\" needs to be replaced.\n\n3. **doing.md** — the role says \"parent 编排者... 调度 subagent\". This is fine (it says \"subagent\" but not a trigger phrase).