E semantics (批判门禁, 反向回流, judgment.md).\n\nThe cleanest approach: Add a new section near the top (after 角色 or after 五派发要素) that documents the explicit pi dispatch syntax. Then in the 各阶段详情, replace \"research subagent:\" with \"runs.run(...) with agent:'research'\" etc. Actually, the current text uses \"research subagent:调研现状事实\" as bullet labels. I can keep the semantic meaning but add explicit syntax.\n\nLet me think about what minimal but complete changes are needed:\n\nThe requirement is to make the trigger explicit. The most important is:\n- Replace \"派发 subagent\" (1 occurrence) with explicit syntax reference.\n- Replace \"main agent\" (2 occurrences, lowercase, but matches regex case-insensitively) with \"parent（编排者）\" or keep \"main agent\"? The regex counts \"main agent\" as a trigger word. I should replace \"main agent\" with something like \"parent orchestrator（本会话主 agent）\" — but that might reintroduce... no, \"主 agent\" is fine, it doesn't match. Actually \"main agent\" (lowercase) matches `Main\\s+Agent` case-insensitively. So I need to avoid the exact string \"main agent\" (case insensitive). I can use \"parent 编排者\" or \"主 agent（parent）\".\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-examine: the regex is `Main\\s+Agent`. It matches \"main agent\", \"Main Agent\", \"MAIN AGENT\", etc. So in sense_loop.md, \"你（main agent）= sense 复核层具象化\" has \"main agent\" → matches. I should change \"main agent\" to \"parent 编排者\" or \"主 agent\" or \"parent orchestrator\".\n\nBut actually, \"主 agent\" in Chinese has a space? If I write \"主 agent\" with a space, does it match any regex? The regex has no \"主 agent\" pattern. So \"主 agent\" is safe. But to be idiomatic and align with pi's \"parent orchestrator\" concept, I'll use \"parent 编排者\" or just \"你（本会话 parent）\".\n\nLet me design the sense_loop.md changes carefully.\n\nPlan for sense_loop.md:\n1. Change the header section title from \"你（main agent）\" to \"你（parent 编排者）\".\n2. Add a new \"## 显式触发语法（pi subagent 工具）\" section after