en_loop_path, gen_domain_path}`\n\nSo learning_loop.md has variables that must match. If I add new `{{}}`, they'd leak. So no new `{{}}` in learning_loop.md.\n\ngen-loop.md: is it used with variable substitution? Let me check. gen-loop.md has `{{loops_dir}}`, `{{skills_dir}}`, `{{domain_dir}}` etc. It's loaded via LoadCoreSkills and written via WriteSkillFile (no vars) or WriteSkillFileWithVars? Let me check where gen-loop is written.\n\nActually, gen-loop.md is written in dream_prompt.go via `WriteSkillFile(promptsDir, \"skill_gen_loop.md\", \"gen-loop\")` (no vars). And in easy_prompt.go via `WriteSkillFile(promptsDir, \"skill_gen_loop.md\", \"gen-loop\")` (no vars). So gen-loop.md's `{{...}}` variables are NOT substituted when written! Wait, let me check. \n\nActually, gen-loop.md is a skill template that's written to disk as-is (with `{{loops_dir}}` etc. as placeholders that the AGENT fills in, not the builder). Let me verify: WriteSkillFile just writes the content as-is. So gen-loop.md retains `{{loops_dir}}` etc. as literal placeholders for the model to read (it's a template the agent uses to CREATE new loops). This is intentional — gen-loop.md is a \"meta\" template for generating loops, so its `{{...}}` are meant to be read literally by the agent, not substituted.\n\nBut wait — this means gen-loop.md's `{{}}` placeholders are intentional. My changes to gen-loop.md must not add NEW `{{}}` beyond what's there, but the existing ones are fine (they're not substituted, they're just read literally).\n\nActually, more importantly: the plan dry-run `{{` check only applies to `plan --dry-run` output. gen-loop.md is not part of plan output. So gen-loop.md's `{{}}` don't affect the plan dry-run check.\n\nBut the doing/easy dry-run — does doing_loop.md get injected with un-substituted `{{}}`? doing_loop.md has `{{domain_dir}}` and `{{debug_skill_path}}`, which loadDoingLoopContent substitutes. So those are fine. If I add new `{{}}` to doing_loop.md, they'd leak into doing/easy prompts.\n\nThe task's key constraint: \"模板经 PromptBuilder 用 {{variable}} 替换，extractVariables 会把模板里任何 {{...}} 当变量——迁移时不得在模板中引入非变量的 {{\".\n\nSo the rule is clear: in my migration, I must not introduce ANY new `{{` in ANY template. My workflowScript examples must not contain `{{`. I've already ensured this (I use single braces `{}`).\n\nNow, let me also verify: does the doing/easy dry-run check for `{{`? The task says: \"./bin/rick plan --dry-run/doing --dry-run/human-loop --dry-run 无 {{\". But the acceptance test (task11.py) only checks plan --dry-run for `{{`. The task description mentions all three, but the test only checks plan. To be safe, I'll ensure no `{{` leaks in doing/easy/human-loop too.\n\nLet me check what commands exist: `rick doing --dry-run`? Let me check the CLI. Actually, let me check if `doing --dry-run` is even a thing. The task mentions `./bin/rick plan --dry-run/doing --dry-run/human-loop --dry-run`. Let me verify these exist.\n\nActually, let me not over-verify. The acceptance test only checks `plan --dry-run` for `{{`. I'll focus on that, but ensure my template changes don't leak `{{` anywhere.\n\nLet me now proceed to make all the edits. I'll start with sense_loop.md.\n\nLet me write the edits for sense_loop.md now using the edit tool.\n\nActually, I realize I should double check one thing about my Edit 3: the code blocks use triple backticks ```` ```text ````. In markdown, these are fine. But I'm editing a .md file that's embedded via go:embed. Backticks in .md are just characters, no issue for Go compilation (the .md is embedded as a string at compile time via go:embed, not as a Go source string). So backticks are totally fine.\n\nWait, actually, I need to reconsider. go:embed embeds the file content as bytes at build time. The .md file is NOT parsed as Go source. So backticks, `${}`, quotes — all fine. Only the Go test FIXTURES (in *_test.go) that reproduce template content would have backtick issues. My migration doesn't add Go test fixtures with backticks (I'm only editing .md files). So no backtick issue.\n\nGood. Let me proceed.\n\nLet me do the sense_loop.md edits now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a complete understanding. Let me start the migration. First, `sense_loop.md` (the core file):"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_XpBUvV9YukgwfGM4OWhe2359","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/sense_loop.md","edits":[{"oldText":"# sense loop（main agent 协议）","newText":"# sense loop（parent 编排者协议）"},{"oldText":"think subagent：{{think_agent_path}}\nresearch subagent：{{research_agent_path}}\nexporter subagent：{{exporter_agent_path}}","newText":"think agent（agent:'think'）：{{think_agent_path}}\nresearch agent（agent:'research'）：{{research_agent_path}}\nexporter agent（agent:'exporter'）：{{exporter_agent_path}}"},{"oldText":"你（main agent）= sense 复核层具象化。控制 **5 阶段**推进节奏：**派发 subagent → 展示简报 → 嵌入批判门禁 → 记录判断 → 派发下一阶段 OR 反向回流**。","newText":"你（parent 编排者）= sense 复核层具象化。控制 **5 阶段**推进节奏：**runs.run 派发子任务 → 展示简报 → 嵌入批判门禁 → 记录判断 → 派发下一阶段 OR 反向回流**。"},{"oldText":"不做事实判断,不替 human 选择视角/矛盾/跃迁方向。批判门禁由你嵌入各阶段执行——subagent 做调研与思考,sense 检查结果。\n\n---\n\n## 推进顺序（5 阶段,允许反向回流）","newText":"不做事实判断,不替 human 选择视角/矛盾/跃迁方向。批判门禁由你嵌入各阶段执行——think/research 做调研与思考,sense 检查结果。\n\n---\n\n## 显式触发语法（pi subagent 工具）\n\n**触发权归属**：只有你（parent 编排者）持 subagent 工具并派发；think/research/exporter 是不持 subagent 工具的普通 child，不得递归派发。每次派发必须用 `subagent({ workflowScript: ... })` + `runs.run`/`runs.all` + 真实 agent 名（`agent:'think'` / `agent:'research'` / `agent:'exporter'`），不再用自然语言描述触发动作。\n\n**运行语义**：\n- 默认 `async: true`（异步）；仅需阻塞前台结果的小步骤才用 `async: false`\n- `context: \"fresh\"`：think/research/exporter 均 fresh（最小新上下文，不继承父会话历史）\n- **单写者**：同一 loop 目录只允许 exporter 一个写者（写 rfc/briefs/judgment）；think/research 只读\n\n**派发 research（单次）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"return runs.run('research-S', { agent: 'research', task: '<compact contract>' })\" })\n```\n\n**派发 think（嵌入门禁）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"return runs.run('think-gate', { agent: 'think', task: '<待审材料 + 4 维打分 + top-N>' })\" })\n```\n\n**并行派发 research + think（阶段 S/E/N/S-R 常规形态）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"const r = await runs.all([{ key: 'research', agent: 'research', task: '<调研任务>' }, { key: 'think', agent: 'think', task: '<门禁任务>' }]); return { research: r[0].output, think: r[1].output }\" })\n```\n\n**派发 exporter（完成阶段，单写者）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"return runs.run('exporter', { agent: 'exporter', task: '<先大纲→human 确认→填内容→产出 rfc>' })\" })\n```\n\ntask 一律按 compact contract 填充（目标/目标物/权限边界/上下文/成功标准/硬约束/验证/输出/停止规则），即下方「五派发要素」。\n\n---\n\n## 推进顺序（5 阶段,允许反向回流）"},{"oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent:调研现状事实(用尽调树)\n- think subagent(嵌入批判门禁):对 human 回答执行假设追问","newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all，见「显式触发语法」）:\n- agent:'research'：调研现状事实(用尽调树)\n- agent:'think'（嵌入批判门禁）:对 human 回答执行假设追问"},{"oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent(可多次):跨领域调研,引用相关理论,产出多视角候选\n- think subagent(嵌入门禁):对每个视角候选执行 4 维打分+top-N","newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all）:\n- agent:'research'（可多次）:跨领域调研,引用相关理论,产出多视角候选\n- agent:'think'（嵌入门禁）:对每个视角候选执行 4 维打分+top-N"},{"oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent:基于视角调研系统组成,找出 node/input/output/inner/edge\n- think subagent(嵌入门禁):对系统描述符执行假设分析","newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all）:\n- agent:'research'：基于视角调研系统组成,找出 node/input/output/inner/edge\n- agent:'think'（嵌入门禁）:对系统描述符执行假设分析"},{"oldText":"**派发**:\n- think subagent:对每个矛盾状态三维打分,输出 top-N 矛盾","newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run）:\n- agent:'think'：对每个矛盾状态三维打分,输出 top-N 矛盾"},{"oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent:对逆转逻辑做尽调,为 human 给出可选项\n- think subagent(嵌入门禁):对逆转逻辑执行假设分析","newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all）:\n- agent:'research'：对逆转逻辑做尽调,为 human 给出可选项\n- agent:'think'（嵌入门禁）:对逆转逻辑执行假设分析"},{"oldText":"执行时派发 think subagent(用 v2 4 维打分+top-N):","newText":"执行时派发 think（`agent:'think'`，用 v2 4 维打分+top-N）:"},{"oldText":"1. 派发 exporter subagent:先确认大纲 → human 确认 → 填内容 → 产出 `{{rfc_dir}}`/rfc-[主题]-[日期].md","newText":"1. 派发 exporter（`agent:'exporter'`）:先确认大纲 → human 确认 → 填内容 → 产出 `{{rfc_dir}}`/rfc-[主题]-[日期].md"},{"oldText":"- **human 提调研问题**:临时派给 research subagent,结果原文展示,不中断主流程","newText":"- **human 提调研问题**:临时派给 research（`agent:'research'`）,结果原文展示,不中断主流程"},{"oldText":"复述主题确认理解,等 human 确认,派发 **S 问题确认**(research subagent 调研现状事实)。","newText":"复述主题确认理解,等 human 确认,派发 **S 问题确认**（`agent:'research'` 调研现状事实）。"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":816,"output":3428,"cacheRead":137600,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1589,"totalTokens":141844,"cost":{"input":0.00035496000000000003,"output":0.0029823600000000003,"cacheRead":0.0004988,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00383612}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915153974,"responseId":"64f6551a-20f9-4a1f-af4a-0b0fc3e13813","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_XpBUvV9YukgwfGM4OWhe2359","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Could not find edits[1] in /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/sense_loop.md. The oldText must match exactly including all whitespace and newlines."}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1786915184612}]}
