{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"The header has backticks around the variable: `think subagent：\\`{{think_agent_path}}\\``. So the actual text is `think subagent：`{{think_agent_path}}`` with backticks. My oldText was missing the backticks. Let me fix.\n\nThe exact text:\n```\nthink subagent：`{{think_agent_path}}`\nresearch subagent：`{{research_agent_path}}`\nexporter subagent：`{{exporter_agent_path}}`\n```\n\nSo my edit 1 oldText should be:\n`think subagent：\\`{{think_agent_path}}\\`\\nresearch subagent：\\`{{research_agent_path}}\\`\\nexporter subagent：\\`{{exporter_agent_path}}\\``\n\nLet me redo the whole edit with corrected oldText for edits[1].\n\nActually, let me re-apply all edits with the corrected header."}}
{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":1,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_OAVXqHnPB9ts9aEc5Q7F5196","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"# sense loop（parent 编排者协议）","oldText":"# sense loop（main agent 协议）"},{"newText":"think agent（agent:'think'）：`{{think_agent_path}}`\nresearch agent（agent:'research'）：`{{research_agent_path}}`\nexporter agent（agent:'exporter'）：`{{exporter_agent_path}}`","oldText":"think subagent：`{{think_agent_path}}`\nresearch subagent：`{{research_agent_path}}`\nexporter subagent：`{{exporter_agent_path}}`"},{"newText":"你（parent 编排者）= sense 复核层具象化。控制 **5 阶段**推进节奏：**runs.run 派发子任务 → 展示简报 → 嵌入批判门禁 → 记录判断 → 派发下一阶段 OR 反向回流**。","oldText":"你（main agent）= sense 复核层具象化。控制 **5 阶段**推进节奏：**派发 subagent → 展示简报 → 嵌入批判门禁 → 记录判断 → 派发下一阶段 OR 反向回流**。"},{"newText":"不做事实判断,不替 human 选择视角/矛盾/跃迁方向。批判门禁由你嵌入各阶段执行——think/research 做调研与思考,sense 检查结果。\n\n---\n\n## 显式触发语法（pi subagent 工具）\n\n**触发权归属**：只有你（parent 编排者）持 subagent 工具并派发；think/research/exporter 是不持 subagent 工具的普通 child，不得递归派发。每次派发必须用 `subagent({ workflowScript: ... })` + `runs.run`/`runs.all` + 真实 agent 名（`agent:'think'` / `agent:'research'` / `agent:'exporter'`），不再用自然语言描述触发动作。\n\n**运行语义**：\n- 默认 `async: true`（异步）；仅需阻塞前台结果的小步骤才用 `async: false`\n- `context: \"fresh\"`：think/research/exporter 均 fresh（最小新上下文，不继承父会话历史）\n- **单写者**：同一 loop 目录只允许 exporter 一个写者（写 rfc/briefs/judgment）；think/research 只读\n\n**派发 research（单次）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"return runs.run('research-S', { agent: 'research', task: '<compact contract>' })\" })\n```\n\n**派发 think（嵌入门禁）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"return runs.run('think-gate', { agent: 'think', task: '<待审材料 + 4 维打分 + top-N>' })\" })\n```\n\n**并行派发 research + think（阶段 S/E/N/S-R 常规形态）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"const r = await runs.all([{ key: 'research', agent: 'research', task: '<调研任务>' }, { key: 'think', agent: 'think', task: '<门禁任务>' }]); return { research: r[0].output, think: r[1].output }\" })\n```\n\n**派发 exporter（完成阶段，单写者）**：\n```text\nsubagent({ workflowScript: \"return runs.run('exporter', { agent: 'exporter', task: '<先大纲→human 确认→填内容→产出 rfc>' })\" })\n```\n\ntask 一律按 compact contract 填充（目标/目标物/权限边界/上下文/成功标准/硬约束/验证/输出/停止规则），即下方「五派发要素」。\n\n---\n\n## 推进顺序（5 阶段,允许反向回流）","oldText":"不做事实判断,不替 human 选择视角/矛盾/跃迁方向。批判门禁由你嵌入各阶段执行——subagent 做调研与思考,sense 检查结果。\n\n---\n\n## 推进顺序（5 阶段,允许反向回流）"},{"newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all，见「显式触发语法」）:\n- agent:'research'：调研现状事实(用尽调树)\n- agent:'think'（嵌入批判门禁）:对 human 回答执行假设追问","oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent:调研现状事实(用尽调树)\n- think subagent(嵌入批判门禁):对 human 回答执行假设追问"},{"newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all）:\n- agent:'research'（可多次）:跨领域调研,引用相关理论,产出多视角候选\n- agent:'think'（嵌入门禁）:对每个视角候选执行 4 维打分+top-N","oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent(可多次):跨领域调研,引用相关理论,产出多视角候选\n- think subagent(嵌入门禁):对每个视角候选执行 4 维打分+top-N"},{"newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all）:\n- agent:'research'：基于视角调研系统组成,找出 node/input/output/inner/edge\n- agent:'think'（嵌入门禁）:对系统描述符执行假设分析","oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent:基于视角调研系统组成,找出 node/input/output/inner/edge\n- think subagent(嵌入门禁):对系统描述符执行假设分析"},{"newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run）:\n- agent:'think'：对每个矛盾状态三维打分,输出 top-N 矛盾","oldText":"**派发**:\n- think subagent:对每个矛盾状态三维打分,输出 top-N 矛盾"},{"newText":"**派发**（用 runs.run / runs.all）:\n- agent:'research'：对逆转逻辑做尽调,为 human 给出可选项\n- agent:'think'（嵌入门禁）:对逆转逻辑执行假设分析","oldText":"**派发**:\n- research subagent:对逆转逻辑做尽调,为 human 给出可选项\n- think subagent(嵌入门禁):对逆转逻辑执行假设分析"},{"newText":"执行时派发 think（`agent:'think'`，用 v2 4 维打分+top-N）:","oldText":"执行时派发 think subagent(用 v2 4 维打分+top-N):"},{"newText":"1. 派发 exporter（`agent:'exporter'`）:先确认大纲 → human 确认 → 填内容 → 产出 `{{rfc_dir}}`/rfc-[主题]-[日期].md","oldText":"1. 派发 exporter subagent:先确认大纲 → human 确认 → 填内容 → 产出 `{{rfc_dir}}`/rfc-[主题]-[日期].md"},{"newText":"- **human 提调研问题**:临时派给 research（`agent:'research'`）,结果原文展示,不中断主流程","oldText":"- **human 提调研问题**:临时派给 research subagent,结果原文展示,不中断主流程"},{"newText":"复述主题确认理解,等 human 确认,派发 **S 问题确认**（`agent:'research'` 调研现状事实）。","oldText":"复述主题确认理解,等 human 确认,派发 **S 问题确认**(research subagent 调研现状事实)。"}],"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/sense_loop.md"}}}}
