{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"sense_loop.md now has 0 trigger phrases, 19 SENSE keyword hits, 11 pi syntax hits, and agent names present. \n\nNow let me migrate the other files. Let me do research.md (top-level) next.\n\nresearch.md has:\n- Line 11: \"research = main agent + 调度器。**不直接调研**,只维护尽调树、配置信源、派发 subagent、整合报告。\" (1× \"main agent\" + 1× \"派发 subagent\")\n- Line 47: \"b. 派发 subagent(传:节点路径+信源配置+调研动作约束)\" (1× \"派发 subagent\")\n- Also \"subagent 上下文隔离\", \"整合所有 subagent 报告\", \"subagent 报告写入\", \"subagent 派发模板\", \"subagent 不持全树上下文\", \"subagent 报告必须落盘\", \"subagent 私自计算置信度\"\n\nI need to:\n1. Change \"main agent\" → \"parent 编排者\"\n2. Change \"派发 subagent\" (2×) → \"runs.run 派发子任务\" or explicit syntax\n3. Add explicit trigger syntax (workflowScript + agent:'research')\n4. Keep \"subagent\" keyword (test requirement: TestResearchTemplateHasDiligenceTree checks for \"subagent\")\n\nLet me read research.md again to get exact text for edits. I have it from earlier. Let me make the edits.\n\nKey edits for research.md:\n\nEdit 1 (角色):\nold: `research = main agent + 调度器。**不直接调研**,只维护尽调树、配置信源、派发 subagent、整合报告。`\nnew: `research = parent 编排者 + 调度器。**不直接调研**,只维护尽调树、配置信源、用 runs.run 派发子任务、整合报告。`\n\nEdit 2 (Step 2 调研循环):\nold: `  b. 派发 subagent(传:节点路径+信源配置+调研动作约束)`\nnew: `  b. runs.run 派发子任务（`agent:'research'`，传:节点路径+信源配置+调研动作约束）`\n\nEdit 3 (Step 3 输出):\nold: `整合所有 subagent 报告:整合摘要(总节点数/高置信度叶节点数/R7 上报项)+ R7 上报项清单 → 呈现 sense_loop → human 决策。`\nKeep (contains \"subagent\" but not trigger). Actually this is fine.\n\nEdit 4 (subagent 派发模板 section): add explicit syntax. The section header is \"## subagent 派发模板\". I'll add a trigger syntax note.\n\nActually, let me add a trigger syntax section to research.md too, similar to sense_loop.md but focused on research's internal dispatch (research dispatches sub-research tasks). Wait, but research is itself an agent (agent:'research'). Can research recursively spawn subagents? Per BP-8, ordinary children do NOT hold the subagent tool. So research (a custom agent with tools read/grep/find/ls/bash/web_search/fetch_content) does NOT have the subagent tool!\n\nThis is an important semantic point. In the current research.md, \"research = main agent + 调度器\" dispatches sub-subagents for each node. But under pi's model, research is an ordinary child agent without the subagent tool, so it CANNOT recursively spawn. The orchestration (who dispatches) must be the parent (sense_loop).\n\nSo the migration for research.md should clarify: research does NOT recursively spawn sub-subagents. Instead, research itself performs the leaf-node research (it has read/grep/find/ls/bash/web_search/fetch_content tools). The \"subagent 上下文隔离\" concept needs to be reinterpreted: the isolation is achieved by research's fresh context (each research dispatch is a fresh context), not by nested subagents.\n\nHmm, this is a semantic nuance. Let me think about what's the right migration here.\n\nActually, looking at the KR and task again:\n- KR1: \"覆盖 sense_loop（think/research/exporter 派发）\" — the key is sense_loop dispatches think/research/exporter.\n- research.md is the research agent's OWN prompt (its system prompt / skill). It currently describes research as \"main agent + 调度器\" that dispatches sub-subagents.\n\nUnder pi best practices (BP-8), research as a child should NOT spawn subagents. So the migration should:\n1. Clarify research is a child agent (agent:'research'), not a \"main agent\".\n2. research performs research directly (it has the tools), no nested dispatch.\n3. The \"subagent 上下文隔离\" → reinterpret as \"fresh context isolation\" (each research dispatch is fresh).\n\nBut wait — the test TestResearchTemplateHasDiligenceTree requires research.md to contain \"subagent\" keyword. So I must keep at least one \"subagent\" occurrence. I can keep it in a note like \"research 不持 subagent 工具（不递归派发）\".\n\nLet me think about the minimal correct migration for research.md:\n\n1. Change \"research = main agent + 调度器\" → \"research = child agent（agent:'research'）+ 尽调树维护者\".\n2. Change \"派发 subagent\" occurrences → clarify research does NOT spawn nested subagents; it performs leaf research directly.\n3. Keep \"subagent\" keyword somewhere (e.g., \"research 不持 subagent 工具\").\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The concept \"subagent 上下文隔离\" in research.md means: \"具体调研派给 subagent 落盘\" (specific research tasks dispatched to subagent for context isolation). Under pi model, this isolation is achieved differently: each research run is fresh context, and research writes reports to disk (briefs/).\n\nLet me rewrite research.md's role and workflow to align with pi:\n\nRole section:\n```\n## 角色\n\nresearch = child agent（agent:'research'），由 sense_loop parent 用 runs.run 派发。**不递归派发**（research 不持 subagent 工具），只维护尽调树、配置信源、执行叶节点调研、整合报告。\n\n3 个概念:\n1. **尽调树**:每层 MECE 划分(不重复不遗漏),节点产生疑问则下钻\n2. **信源加权**:置信度 = Σ(信源验证结果 × 权重)\n3. **上下文隔离**:每个叶节点调研在 research 单次 fresh 会话内完成并落盘（research 不持 subagent 工具，不递归派发）\n```\n\nWait, but this is getting complicated. Let me keep it simpler and focused on the acceptance + semantic requirements.\n\nThe key semantic requirement (from task): \"触发权归属显式化：parent 持编排权、单写者、async/context 语义写入相关模板\". So research.md should state that research is a child, parent (sense_loop) holds orchestration.\n\nLet me do a focused rewrite of research.md:\n\n1. 角色: change \"main agent + 调度器\" → \"child agent（agent:'research'），由 parent 编排者 runs.run 派发；不递归派发（不持 subagent 工具）\".\n\n2. Add a note about trigger syntax (how parent dispatches research).\n\n3. Change \"派发 subagent\" (2×) → \"派发子任务\" or \"执行叶节点调研\".\n\n4. The \"subagent 派发模板\" section → rename to \"叶节点调研模板\" or keep \"subagent\" keyword there. Actually, keep \"subagent\" in a clarifying sentence.\n\nLet me also think: does research.md get any variable substitution? It's loaded via human_loop_prompt.go with variables draft_dir/rfc_dir/loop_dir/research_skill_path. And it's also used as the agent system prompt via env/agents.go (LoadCoreSkills([]string{\"research\"}) → templates/skills/research.md, NOT templates/research.md). Wait, let me check.\n\nenv/agents.go: `body := prompt.LoadCoreSkills([]string{spec.name})` where spec.name = \"research\". LoadCoreSkills(\"research\") reads `templates/skills/research.md` (skillPath maps name → \"templates/skills/\" + name + \".md\").\n\nSo the agent's system prompt = `templates/skills/research.md` (the skill file), NOT `templates/research.md` (the top-level research template).\n\nThe top-level `templates/research.md` is the research SUBAGENT prompt (built by human_loop_prompt.go GenerateHumanLoopPromptFile). Wait, but in the new pi model, research is registered as a custom agent with system prompt = skills/research.md. The top-level templates/research.md is the OLD research subagent prompt that gets written to prompts/research.md.\n\nHmm, this is a bit confusing. Let me understand the current architecture:\n- `templates/research.md` (top-level) = the research prompt template used by human_loop_prompt.go to build `prompts/research.md`. This is the OLD subagent prompt file.\n- `templates/skills/research.md` = the research SKILL (methodology), which is ALSO used as the custom agent's system prompt (via env/agents.go).\n\nIn the new pi model (after task9), research is a custom agent (agent:'research') with system prompt = skills/research.md content. The top-level templates/research.md is still built into prompts/research.md for... legacy? Or for the sense_loop to reference?\n\nActually, looking at human_loop_prompt.go, it still builds think/research/exporter files into promptsDir. These are the \"subagent prompt files\". But in the new model, the sense_loop parent dispatches by agent NAME (agent:'research'), and the agent's system prompt comes from the registered agent file (skills/research.md). So the top-level templates/research.md is somewhat redundant now, but it's still generated.\n\nFor my migration, both files matter:\n- `templates/research.md` (top-level) — needs trigger word migration.\n- `templates/skills/research.md` — the agent's actual system prompt, needs to clarify it's a child agent (no recursive dispatch).\n\nLet me migrate both. But note the test TestResearchTemplateHasDiligenceTree checks `templates/research.md` (top-level, via LoadTemplate(\"research\")) for \"subagent\" keyword.\n\nOK, let me now do the research.md (top-level) edits.\n\nActually, let me step back and think about efficiency. I have 8 more files to migrate. Let me be systematic and efficient. Let me write out all edits.\n\nLet me first read the current research.md exact lines to make precise edits. I already have it. Let me make the edits.\n\nresearch.md top-level edits:\n\n1. Line 11 (角色):\nold: `research = main agent + 调度器。**不直接调研**,只维护尽调树、配置信源、派发 subagent、整合报告。`\nnew: `research = child agent（agent:'research'），由 sense_loop parent 用 runs.run 派发。**不递归派发**（不持 subagent 工具），只维护尽调树、配置信源、执行叶节点调研、整合报告。`\n\n2. Line 15 (概念 3):\nold: `3. **subagent 上下文隔离**:具体调研派给 subagent 落盘`\nnew: `3. **上下文隔离**:每个叶节点调研在单次 fresh 会话内执行并落盘（research 不持 subagent 工具，不递归派发）`\n\nWait, but this removes \"subagent\" from line 15. But the test needs \"subagent\" somewhere. Line 11 now has \"subagent\" (in \"不持 subagent 工具\"). Good. So \"subagent\" keyword is still present.\n\n3. Line 47 (调研循环 b):\nold: `  b. 派发 subagent(传:节点路径+信源配置+调研动作约束)`\nnew: `  b. 执行叶节点调研（传:节点路径+信源配置+调研动作约束，research 自身执行）`\n\n4. Line 59 (Step 3):\nold: `整合所有 subagent 报告:整合摘要(总节点数/高置信度叶节点数/R7 上报项)+ R7 上报项清单 → 呈现 sense_loop → human 决策。`\nThis has \"subagent\" but not a trigger. I can leave it or update to \"调研报告\". Let me update to \"整合所有叶节点报告\". Actually, to keep \"subagent\" keyword present (it's in line 11 now), I can freely change this. Let me change to \"整合所有叶节点调研报告\".\n\n5. Line 96 \"## subagent 派发模板\" — this section. Change header to \"## 叶节点调研模板\" and update content.\n\nActually, let me look at the \"subagent 派发模板\" section content:\n```\n## suba