p.md`\". And Step 0.2 \"搜索 `.rick/domain/`\" (literal, not `{{domain_dir}}`).\n\nLet me check what variables gen-loop.md uses. From my read:\n- `{{loops_dir}}` (line 13: \"每个 Loop 写入 `{{loops_dir}}/{name}-loop.md`\")\n- Step 4 引用 `{{skills_dir}}`? Let me check. Actually I don't think gen-loop.md has `{{skills_dir}}`. Let me grep.\n\nActually, gen-loop.md is written to disk via WriteSkillFile (no var substitution), so its `{{}}` remain literal (intended as placeholders for the AGENT to fill when generating a loop). So I must NOT introduce new `{{}}`.\n\nMy gen-loop.md edits only change \"Main Agent\"/\"Sub Agent\"/\"SPAWN Sub Agent\" → \"parent\"/\"worker child\"/\"runs.run\". No new `{{}}`. Good.\n\nLet me write the gen-loop.md edits.\n\nFor the ASCII diagram in gen-loop.md (lines 72-85):\n```\n[Main Agent]\n   │\n   ├─ SPAWN Sub Agent（携带：任务目标 + debug/摘要 + 迭代编号 N）\n   │     │\n   │     │  Sub Agent 执行：\n   │     │  [{Step A}] → [{Step B}] → [COMMIT]\n   │     │      ↑              │\n   │     │      └──[DEBUG]─────┘\n   │     │\n   │     └─ Sub Agent 完成，输出产出摘要\n   │\n   └─ Main Agent 执行 Step 4 产出评估\n```\n\nNew:\n```\n[parent 编排者]\n   │\n   ├─ runs.run 派发 worker child（agent:'worker'，携带：任务目标 + debug/摘要 + 迭代编号 N）\n   │     │\n   │     │  worker child 执行：\n   │     │  [{Step A}] → [{Step B}] → [COMMIT]\n   │     │      ↑              │\n   │     │      └──[DEBUG]─────┘\n   │     │\n   │     └─ worker child 完成，输出产出摘要\n   │\n   └─ parent 执行 Step 4 产出评估\n```\n\nAnd \"**Sub Agent：{Step A 名称}**\" → \"**worker child：{Step A 名称}**\", etc.\n\nLet me write the edits."}}
